+        # When the PLE table is host-offloaded, construct only its parameter
+        # metadata here. Qwen4ExpPinnedHostEmbedding below allocates the real
+        # table directly in pinned CPU memory. Without this meta-device staging,
+        # VocabParallelEmbedding first materializes the full TP-local table on
+        # CUDA (about 11.9 GiB for Qwen3.8 TP4) before immediately offloading it.
+        embedding_init_context = (
+            torch.device("meta") if config.ple_offload_embedding else nullcontext()
